FORM K-1.
IN THE MATTER OF: the-supervisor.

OFF THE RECORD: supervision. The supervisor commences a ward that is
OFF THE RECORD: certain to be convicted, then checks on it at
OFF THE RECORD: intervals with THE STANDING OF. Each reading is
OFF THE RECORD: entered in the ledger, so the whole vigil replays
OFF THE RECORD: bit for bit, verdict and all.

ARTICLE 1.
    PROCLAIM THE STANDING OF "case-that-never-was".
    COMMENCE PROCEEDINGS UPON
        "FORM K-1. IN THE MATTER OF: the-ward. ARTICLE 1. HOLD \"predictably\" IN CONTEMPT.",
        FILED UNDER ward.

ARTICLE 2.
    ADJOURN FOR 2 DAYS.
    SHOULD THE STANDING OF ward EQUAL "GUILTY",
        PROCLAIM "the ward has been convicted; the supervisor is not surprised".
    FAILING WHICH,
        REFER TO ARTICLE 2.
    ADJOURN INDEFINITELY.
